## Financial Statement Analysis

The financial statement analysis reveals critical data extraction failures that prevent comprehensive credit evaluation. The automated financial statement spread system was unable to extract any core financial metrics from the uploaded tax returns covering 2022-2024.

All essential financial data points are missing, including:
